{"summary":"A different kind of endless runner!","description":"You are a solar-powered craft. The sun is your death timer. Hurtle towards the sunset at breakneck speed in a futile race against time. Delay the inevitable by catching speed boosts which reverse the setting sun - if only for a moment. Race The Sun: Daily Challenge Edition is inspired by arcade games of the past with a focus on high scores, short game sessions, and pure fun mingled with nerve-wracking tension. The rules are simple: don't crash, stay in the light, and don't slow down!\n\nThis new edition of the game includes several new features including new alternate ships, colorful new trails, and a new \"daily challenge\" system that will test the skills of even the most experienced players.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $99.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zeeGvlb7Ers?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/alc8MobbDb8l6kVCBjzKOLn6th_QVAsMFLC1RUbDDVL7EfjayxgdqmdSHC1jWOrIbNdx4bqNdIdf0oRU7FgO3w","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0-WKeD8nr-mymckO0GlDzV82CPaCFMQqGjvvPzq5oW8QZWaGau809CdhQOaYdIh8Lxubohi2fZIqPglrVdx9EA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VxRrZmHKKcrOL1zVkuTM6Io1rPYnoDoFbkF4fnpHShfgCP-nUEDawI4ekSdCpAsRE5OUUr9nHV2bElu0RIXRbSo","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DxmtEU_7sPmKSjepynB-eDgUJMN2n6bgUTj5jqldF0UGCNdA6nRzprsY7X6d4HFQXHdbbnUkVhcCqCsyfXfa7g","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kM7nrbL1Js2f9xwKdgv0usN16jJq-0a9p6Trctgn8p5MlGAUTvxTam4EeYWhF1a_pnAZc5N1D8hJEohlo7iGCQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CybhJ6B6r72RhqVsUWX6ZA2nZkagGZ47spTax6CeXzHAd_296Eo8BZsdz5x2sSiP3Qj97uJrXqEuEkrbcWkcAi0","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gLzQndxqRZ4UDHyl0pf-tIqz8m1uZabmll5FKT6scYkojDpEkfu_9BWtoS3DJYn8IWLUbu0yJlw4GPuCIt_6","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-UZ62TypLDcrCSPNETp5PUbfhy1uElDZrJqJogQQygMaJH-DDDNXnkRch6c3A7YC-q15fNqLqALow5WF2V2gMg","https://play-lh.googleusercon